  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil kettle.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d524607542c1f3dcc331-0aa2460b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook risoni in boiling water over high heat until ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins.\n• Drain and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d524607542c1f3dcc331-ffb5aba6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion and mushrooms until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add pesto-flavoured powder, the water, risoni and vegetable stock. Bring to boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d524607542c1f3dcc331-e7cfe905.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir Parmesan cheese, the butter and baby spinach through risoni.\n• Add a splash of water to loosen risoni if needed. Season to taste.\n• Divide risoni between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d524607542c1f3dcc331-af52bb11.jpeg"
    }
  ]
